      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">My main question which was raised with Jemsk during play last weekend is does a card drawn as a result as an End of Turn count as being as in play at the end of the turn, or does it not count as played until after the turn? &nbsp;We played the latter.</span></p><p>And unless we&#39;re missing something there&#39;s no such thing as End of Turn card priority - that it&#39;s up to the players to determine the order in which End of Turn effects are carried out.</p>",
